IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fhog-core`
IMPORT `fhog-seat`

-- Cases for the first home buyer's seat (fhog-seat.l4) and the regulative rules of the core (fhog-core.l4).
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited Act (act-2000-014.txt) and Regulation (sl-2021-0018.txt),
-- never copied from the encoding's output; the working is in the comment above each assertion. No scenario life raised
-- this Act: the buyers are the encoder's, HYPOTHETICAL throughout.
--
-- A breached or still-pending DEONTIC cannot be asserted on the stable l4, so regulative rules are asserted where the
-- trace ends FULFILLED, and #TRACEd with an "-- expect:" line where it does not. Clock: days.
--
-- PLUMBING. The helpers in the next section only pass answers through to the seat's questions, filling the answers a
-- case does not vary with the plain value given in their comment. They hold no rule.

`10 Sep 2026`  MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 10 9 2026
